{"5316540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tidy Up the Halloween Shop","steam_appid":5316540,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"You expected a quiet little Halloween shop. You open the door to find its contents scattered everywhere. Time to put things right—and perhaps find out what happened.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An armful at a time<\/h2>Pick up scattered treasures and return them to their shelves. From curious potions and tiny familiars to pumpkins, sweets and autumn flowers, there’s a whole shop of spooky little things to sort. Enjoy the satisfaction of everything finding its place, at your own pace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little out of the ordinary<\/h2>Some things need more than tidying away. Follow strange clues, discover the shop’s secrets, and find a friend who may know something about the mess.<br><br>Settle in. There’s no timer, and you might have company.","about_the_game":"You expected a quiet little Halloween shop. You open the door to find its contents scattered everywhere. Time to put things right—and perhaps find out what happened.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An armful at a time<\/h2>Pick up scattered treasures and return them to their shelves. From curious potions and tiny familiars to pumpkins, sweets and autumn flowers, there’s a whole shop of spooky little things to sort. Enjoy the satisfaction of everything finding its place, at your own pace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A little out of the ordinary<\/h2>Some things need more than tidying away. Follow strange clues, discover the shop’s secrets, and find a friend who may know something about the mess.<br><br>Settle in. There’s no timer, and you might have company.","short_description":"Something has made a spectacular mess of this cozy Halloween shop. Put pumpkins, potions and sweets back where they belong, uncover curious clues, and meet a mysterious new friend. A relaxing first-person tidy-up, with a little mischief.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Frenc